    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it’s not just people being busy. it’s a clean break. i’ve seen the way they look at me, or how they just look right through me. it’s like the version of me that mattered is just dead. maybe it’s just better to let that be true, you know? if the person i was is gone, then what's the point of waiting around for a body that doesn't even belong anywhere anymore?",
